   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "f5d92313-6353-4059-bdd9-d020782ed5e2",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "Parameters:\n",
    "\n",
    "- `alpha`: Try a range of values, for example powers of 10 from 0.0001 to 1000 and \r\n",
    "Use higher alpha f r simpler models and lower alpha for more complex mode\n",
    "\n",
    "\n",
    "s\n",
    "- `solver`: For larger datasets, iterative solvers like ‘sag’ and ‘saga’ are more effici\n",
    "n\n",
    "t\n",
    "Source: https://sklearner.com/"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 28,
   "id": "7b5ed6f7-8356-4a2c-88b0-f4478841528e",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "ridge_param_grid = {\n",
    "     \"model__alpha\": [0.01, 0.1, 1, 10, 100],\n",
    "     # \"model__solver\": ['sag', 'saga']\n",
    "    }"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 29,
   "id": "dfd554b7-43ae-4486-864c-0271614c2b9d",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "ridge_grid = GridSearchCV(\n",
    "    estimator=ridge_pipeline, \n",
    "    param_grid=ridge_param_grid,\n",
    "    scoring='neg_mean_squared_error', # I need to verify the scoring choice\n",
    "    cv=cv,\n",
    "    n_jobs=-1,\n",
    "    refit='neg_mean_squared_error',\n",
    "    return_train_score=True,\n",
    "    verbose=1\n",
    ")"
